   "title": "Borrow Has Had Long Enough",
   "turnin": "r14_undead_elder",
   "xp": 315
  },
  {
   "copper": 1,
   "description": "Listen: for once, that is only the wind among the stones. Follow the road to Mournfen Village and speak with Mordec Silt; the graves in his care are older than ours, and the water is rising around them. Come back when you can, preferably on your own feet.",
